    "en": "Your kamioshi's stream abruptly ends one day & his silence creates rampant rumors. Avoiding the online toxicity, you join a degenerate group chat where VTuber fans chat about their oshis freely. But you start noticing strange coincidences - is your kamioshi in this chat? In this dating chatsim, who's real & who's pretending in chat? lovebyte.exe : inspired by Mystic Messenger, VTubers, and internet spam Game Features 🎙️ Unlock voice-acted scenes from real VTubers such as Roy Chiato, Banzoin Hakka, RiiKami, Kaine Knight, Bluebell, and rachie. 📸 Unlock delulu & parasocial content and CGs across different channels, including streams and discord chats 🎨 Customize your in-game Discord profile & desktop 🔎 Sift through fake surveys, sketchy internet downloads, and sus emails in minigames to avoid scams and earn money to support your kamioshi 🔁 Reveal romanceable characters' irl-selves and explore multiple endings as answer choices matter! Romanceable Characters Piece together the identities of 6 romanceable characters : MINK!! Mochaberry Solo Lightracer WizardPit Dolphin Daddy Pochima Forever 🐸 Frog Game Features Sift through fake surveys, sketchy internet downloads, and sus emails in minigames that blur the line between truth and scam. Can you tell what is real? Unlockable CGs, discord voice calls, DMs, and more Customizable MC Unlockable Achievements Multiple Endings"
